# Quick Add from a zoomed pane with two tasks selected adds to the inbox without changing the pane, and the selection still takes the next command.
file <<END
INBOX:
Work:
	- Write report
	- Review PRs
	- Plan sprint
END
keys gg j . J
keys qi
type Call mom
keys <Enter>
see 󰋜 › Work
keys x
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call mom
Work:
	- Write report @done({today})
	- Review PRs @done({today})
	- Plan sprint
END
